SUMMARY:Zakir Khan Live (A Trial Show) (IN HINDI)
LOCATION:New York Comedy Club on 4th Street\, 85 East 4th Street\, New York
DESCRIPTION:Off the back of the global success of his "Papa Yaar" tour\, Za
 kir Khan is stepping back into the room where it all begins. These are inti
 mate\, limited-seat\, one-night-only shows where he will workshop brand-new
  material before it's ready for the big stage – no polish\, no filter. I
 f you get a chance to be in the room\, you're seeing the next special befor
 e the world does.Zakir Khan is a trailblazing stand-up comedian and writer 
 who has single-handedly redefined the global footprint of Indian stand-up c
 omedy. With a deeply relatable\, anecdotal style and an unmistakably authen
 tic voice\, Khan has gone from a grassroots sensation in India to a certifi
 ed international arena act—breaking box office records and selling out so
 me of the world's most iconic venues along the way.This event will be a pho
 ne-free experience. Use of phones\, smartwatches. and accessories will not 
 be permitted in the performance space. Upon arrival at the venue\, all phon
 es\, smart watches\, and accessories will be secured in individual Yondr po
 uches that will be opened at the end of the event. Guests maintain possessi
 on of their devices at all times and can access them throughout the event o
 nly in designated Phone Use Areas within the venue. All devices will be re-
 secured in Yondr pouches before returning to the performance space.\nMore i
 nfo: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/zakir-khan-live-a-trial-sho
 w-in-hindi/
